claim.claim-text:
i. 25 to 95 wt. % of the solid dispersion;
ii. 15 to 72.5 wt.% of a filler;
iii. 2.5 to 40 wt.% of disintegrant;
iv. 0 to 5 wt.% of a lubricant;
v. 0 to 20 wt.% of an inorganic alkaline metal salt; and
vi. a total of 0 to 20 wt.% of one or more additional pharmaceutically acceptable excipients,
based upon the total weight of the tablet.

i. 40 to 60 wt. % of the solid dispersion;
ii. 25 to 55 wt.% of a filler;
iii. 5 to 30 wt.% of disintegrant;
iv. 0 to 5 wt.% of a lubricant;
v. 0 to 15 wt.% of an inorganic alkaline metal salt; and
vi. a total of 0 to 10 wt.% of one or more additional pharmaceutically acceptable excipients,
based upon the total weight of the tablet.

i. 35 to 55 wt. % of the composite according to any of claims 1 to 11;
ii. 30 to 55 wt.% of a filler;
iii. 5 to 20 wt.% of disintegrant;
iv. 0.25 to 2.5 wt.% of a lubricant;
v. 2.5 to 15 wt.% of an inorganic alkaline metal salt; and
vi. a total of 0 to 10 wt.% of one or more additional pharmaceutically acceptable excipients,
based upon the total weight of the tablet.
